{"unit_id":"777-Zen__dsh-capability-index#card-zh","repo":"777-Zen/dsh-capability-index","commit":"c1803133660c6bc30dbc2d3eda493724b801aad0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-capability-index 是一款 DSH 插件库预检插件，会在 systemPrompt 上下文通道加入工具提示。它读取当前可用工具和能力声明，先用规则匹配任务，再结合本地语义向量排序，并对 not_for 声明进行核对。主要功能包括按任务推荐 Top-K 工具、展示插件库总览、遵循计划阶段只推荐只读工具，以及在语义模型不可用时回退规则路径。适合希望 agent 更稳定发现并使用已有工具的 DSH 部署。语义模型依赖部署环境提供的 transformers，首次使用可从 hf-mirror.com 获取权重。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-60","lib/dsh-adapter.js:244-321","lib/core.js:378-414"]}
{"unit_id":"777-Zen__dsh-capability-index#card-en","repo":"777-Zen/dsh-capability-index","commit":"c1803133660c6bc30dbc2d3eda493724b801aad0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-capability-index adds task-based tool hints to DSH context. It ranks available tools using rules and optional local semantic vectors, checks not_for declarations, and can limit plan-mode suggestions to read-only tools. If semantic matching is unavailable, it falls back to rules.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-60","lib/dsh-adapter.js:244-321","lib/core.js:378-414"]}
